    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion's sniper...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I even made sure to prepare for ranged attacks, but how does he pack this much firepower...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not enough to save your life. You'll die before your sniper can land a shot on me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Wait. Were you arrested by the L.G.D. before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your bunch caused him a great deal of grief. But it's nothing compared to what Ursus did to us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "He missed that shot on purpose, dear Madam. We'll spare your life this once, so take this as a gesture of kindness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now, the seeds of unrest have been sown within the L.G.D.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was your organization's corruption and negligence that gave him the chance to cooperate with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Reunion scum, you know nothing about this world.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Were you trying to say something profound?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you think that Faust was rescued by Reunion?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There were many Infected in the L.G.D. at the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Twenty-one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you think that at least four of them would side with Reunion?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "But even those four were set up by me. After they got in contact with you, did you lock one of them up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Very clever, Madam. She ran away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you still not realized the situation you're now in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I've figured it out. My squad has been crushed, and I'm the only one left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our forces wandering around outside are hopelessly weak, and my comrades have basically lost their will to fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this what you wanted to hear me say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I suppose you're not that arrogant after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well then... Come, my guards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
