    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... Aagghh\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Unghh... Nnngh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "ReUni N MemBr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 3,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Nghhhaaahghh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "ReUMmbr? N;E? OE"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 3,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Grrraaaaaaaaaaaghh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Blood!! Blood!! Aaaargh!!! Aaaaaggh!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto's hERd"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 3,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quiet now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_014"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto's HeRd"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, it's looking bad...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "All the defeated Reunion members started to transform into hulking monstrosities after coming in contact with that powder!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "They've started attacking us again, and they're slowly moving towards our defense line!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just how many of them have transformed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "All of them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They are my herd, as well as my brethren.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "G7, G6.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "...Urgh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto's Herd"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They shall never fall, because I will take away all their pain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just manipulating them like puppets. How can you call them your brethren?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I see no difference between the two. For the greater good, we are willing to become anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If this is what you call the greater good... Looks like you're the only one I need to get rid of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You have a sense of purpose, and the will to get it done. I'm quite drawn to you, Madam.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Focus your fire! Hurry! Aim at the enemy commander!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
