    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "This belongs to you now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't need it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, just treat it as a loan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you not afraid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Afraid of what? You turning against me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I am not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I am not scared of death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is no ordinary weapon. You'll gradually come to understand it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do not waste its power on trivial things. A dragonslaying sword shall only be unsheathed against a worthy enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who you choose to draw this sword upon is entirely up to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(...This sword is still hibernating.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "(You still refuse to be unsheathed even in this situation...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "(But right now, Chi Xiao, you must drink their blood!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
